{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d330f9b088faed5d","name":"Ilum Crystal","source":{"id":"source:reference-d330f9b088faed5d","title":"Ilum Crystal","revision":20442,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:51:12Z","sha256":"5b4ac5b236358091127099b68ea7c417814bfd04c5088e3bd83c02ba0df563f8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20442","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Ilum%20Crystal&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d330f9b088faed5d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Color:"]}," Blue or Green\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["DC Modifier:"]}," +0\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The discovery of the planet ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ilum"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ilum?action=edit&redlink=1"}," was a landmark event in the history of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},". Up until its discovery, finding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Crystals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Crystals"}," to generate the full-strength blades that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"}," required could be tedious and time-consuming. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mephite Crystals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mephite_Crystals?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pontite Crystals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pontite_Crystals"}," made for the best ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," blades, but even in the Adegan System, those ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Crystals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Crystals"}," are rare.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The discovery of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ilum"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ilum?action=edit&redlink=1"}," brought with it entire caves filled with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Crystals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Crystals"}," whose structure was so similar to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mephite Crystals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mephite_Crystals?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pontite Crystals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pontite_Crystals"}," that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," took them to be the same, at first. Jedi who undergo the ritual of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Construction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Construction","referenceId":"reference:4e15cf68aad68938"}," seek out the caves of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ilum"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ilum?action=edit&redlink=1"},", as their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Crystals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Crystals"}," are considered the highest quality.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Ilum Crystals produce a full-strength ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," blade that is either blue or green in color. An Ilum Crystal grants the standard +1 bonus on attack rolls to its attuned wielder, common to most ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
